    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu yashila Musa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako, baana beefwe abatakatifu, abasanjilani khumulango kwaNyasaye, yililisie khuMurume khandi Omukuhani Omukhulundu wakobusuubili aka khwiyamanga, niye Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yali omwisiikwa khu oyo owamuraho, shinga Musa naye olwa yali omwisiikwa munzu yosi yaNyasaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba ye yabasibwa mbu akwanile oluyali olushila olwaMusa, shinga omuumbashi weinzu olwa aba noluyali olushila olweinzu yene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila buli inzu yumbakhwa nomundu; ne omuumbashi wabiosi niNyasaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne toto mwene, Musa yali omwisiikwa munzu yosi yaNyasaye, nali omukholi wamwo, narumbulanga akobuloli khukeenako akali nikali okhuboolwa olunyumakhwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Kristo yali omwisiikwa hekulu khukeinzu yaNyasaye nali omwana wamwo; ne nifwe inzuye, nikhuba nikhulabeetsanga abeikholo nyumu nikhwiyitsialilanga obunaayi bweefwe okhuula khubumaliilishi, oburatendeha ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obuhuluushi obuliho khulwa abandu baNyasaye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako, shinga Roho Omutakatifu olwa aboola",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mubeetsenje meeso, baana beefwe, aleshe okhubamwo mwinywe omundu kata mulala owomwoyo omubii okubula obusuubili okuchila nahunzukha okhurula khuNyasaye oubeetsangaho mwoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa muchesihaninjie obushia olwa yishilangwa mbu \"Leelo\", mbu omundu yesi mwinywe aleshe okhutinyibwa khulwa obukaatii bwobwonooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila nikhuba nikhulabeetsanga abobwisiichi okhuula khubumaliilishi shinga olwa khwali khukhuchaaka, oburatendeha ta, khuba abeshisango shilala nende Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emureeba mbu nibanga wina abahulila nibakhola induli? Shibali abo bosi abarula muMisiri nibeemililwa nende Musa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata nibanga wina aba yasinyishila emiyika amakhumi kane? Shibali abo aboonoona, aba emilambo chiabwe chiakwa mushitsiimi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata khandi nibanga wina aba yeetsubila mbu shibakheenjila mubuhuluushibwe ta, nibarali abo abamukhaya? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho khuluutsi mbu oburasuubila bwabwe bwachila nibaranyala okhwinjilamwo ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
